{"id":10066,"name":"sableye-mega","speciesId":302,"dex":302,"form":"mega","generation":3,"types":["dark","ghost"],"stats":{"hp":50,"attack":85,"defense":125,"special-attack":85,"special-defense":115,"speed":20},"abilities":[{"name":"magic-bounce","hidden":false}],"height":5,"weight":1610,"baseExp":168,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10066.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/10066.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10066.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/10066.ogg","genus":"Darkness Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon das Trevas","flavor":[{"version":"ruby","text":"SABLEYE lead quiet lives deep inside caverns. They are feared, however, because these POKéMON are thought to steal the spirits of people when their eyes burn with a sinister glow in the darkness."},{"version":"sapphire","text":"SABLEYE digs the ground with sharpened claws to find rocks that it eats. Substances in the eaten rocks crystallize and rise up to the POKéMON’s body surface."},{"version":"emerald","text":"It digs branching holes in caves using its sharp claws in search of food--raw gems. A SABLEYE lurks in darkness and is seen only rarely."},{"version":"firered","text":"It feeds on gemstone crystals. In darkness, its eyes sparkle with the glitter of jewels."},{"version":"diamond","text":"It hides in the darkness of caves. Its diet of gems has transformed its eyes into gemstones."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"It dwells in the darkness of caves. It uses its sharp claws to dig up gems to nourish itself."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"Sableye lead quiet lives deep inside caverns. They are feared, however, because these Pokémon are thought to steal the spirits of people when their eyes burn with a sinister glow in the darkness."},{"version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Sableye digs the ground with sharpened claws to find rocks that it eats. Substances in the eaten rocks crystallize and rise up to the Pokémon’s body surface."},{"version":"sun","text":"It’s a fiend for gemstones, so it stalks Carbink. Unfortunately, Gabite almost always grabs them first."},{"version":"moon","text":"This Pokémon is feared. When its gemstone eyes begin to glow with a sinister shine, it’s believed that Sableye will steal people’s spirits away."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"It digs through the ground with its hard claws and crunches down gems with its thick pointy teeth. Carbink is its favorite food."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"Materials from gems it has eaten float to the surface of its body and can form an infinite number of patterns among individuals."}],"flavorPt":"Os materiais das gemas que ele comeu flutuam na superfície de seu corpo e podem formar um número infinito de padrões entre os indivíduos.","genderRate":4,"captureRate":45,"eggGroups":["humanshape"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"sableye","speciesId":302,"evolvesTo":[]},"varieties":[{"id":302,"name":"sableye","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/302.png"},{"id":10066,"name":"sableye-mega","form":"mega","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10066.png"}],"games":[16,17,18],"moves":[{"id":7,"learn":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0]]},{"id":8,"learn":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0]]},{"id":9,"learn":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0]]},{"id":10,"learn":[[16,"lv",1],[17,"lv",1],[18,"lv",1]]},{"id":15,"learn":[[16,"tm",0]]},{"id":43,"learn":[[16,"lv",1],[17,"lv",1],[18,"lv",1]]},{"id":67,"learn":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0]]},{"id":91,"learn":[[16,"tm",0]]},{"id":92,"learn":[[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0]]},{"id":94,"learn":[[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0]]},{"id":101,"learn":[